WEBVTT

00:01.750 --> 00:05.830
Trapped in an endless pitfall of love and crazy about you

00:05.830 --> 00:08.580
Don't let your eyes wander darling, that's a no-no

00:08.580 --> 00:11.920
Pain pain, fly away, until only love remains

00:11.920 --> 00:14.710
My heart is stirring with affection

00:26.000 --> 00:28.960
I hate being alone, just a touch is enough

00:28.960 --> 00:32.000
To be connected y'know, it's a nice feeling y'know

00:32.000 --> 00:35.040
The negative opinions of others don't matter

00:35.040 --> 00:38.130
Like the saying goes, love is blind

00:38.130 --> 00:41.790
I will never have the ultimate fashion sense

00:41.790 --> 00:45.170
Is it envy? Or misery? In this story

00:45.170 --> 00:47.830
Feelings communicated in mentions

00:47.830 --> 00:51.830
C'mon, I want it communicated in words

00:51.830 --> 00:55.960
Trapped in an endless pitfall of love and crazy about you

00:55.960 --> 00:58.630
Don't let your eyes wander darling, that's a no-no

00:58.630 --> 01:02.080
Pain pain, fly away, until only love remains

01:02.080 --> 01:04.500
Although it's also stressful

01:04.500 --> 01:07.710
Cheating and drowning in dreams

01:07.710 --> 01:10.960
There's no realistic romance anymore

01:11.170 --> 01:14.250
Trapped in a pitfall of love and crazy about you

01:14.250 --> 01:16.960
My heart is stirring with affection

01:17.170 --> 01:18.750
La la la la la

01:18.750 --> 01:20.210
Compulsive, I need you

01:20.210 --> 01:21.880
La la la la la

01:21.880 --> 01:23.210
Loneliness is a disease

01:23.210 --> 01:24.830
La la la la la

01:24.830 --> 01:26.380
Blind, I need you

01:26.380 --> 01:29.290
Now and forever, I wanna be crazy about you

01:39.380 --> 01:40.790
What's the deal?

01:39.380 --> 01:41.420
<b>Octopus Feed</b>

01:45.710 --> 01:49.710
What are we about to see that requires
all this hoity-toityness?

01:50.000 --> 01:51.830
You're about to meet my dear friends.

01:51.830 --> 01:53.920
I've always wanted to introduce them to you.

01:59.250 --> 02:02.170
Aw, there they are!
You're looking great today!

02:02.170 --> 02:04.790
Gather up! It's time to eat!

02:04.790 --> 02:06.130
Octopuses?

02:09.330 --> 02:11.250
There's a whole pool full of them!

02:11.250 --> 02:12.580
Seriously, Mendo?

02:12.580 --> 02:15.710
You gathered us all at your place
just to show us these stupid things?

02:15.710 --> 02:17.420
Don't call them "stupid things"!

02:17.420 --> 02:20.080
You're meeting with important members
of the Mendo family!

02:20.080 --> 02:21.420
Have some respect!

02:22.540 --> 02:23.880
These octopuses?

02:23.880 --> 02:26.130
That's right, Miss Ryunosuke!

02:26.380 --> 02:27.880
As you all know,

02:27.880 --> 02:30.000
the crest of the Mendo family is the Hyottoko!

02:30.000 --> 02:31.330
And...

02:31.330 --> 02:33.250
octopuses are nearly identical to that!

02:33.250 --> 02:35.830
So naturally, the Mendo family
have all revered octopuses

02:35.830 --> 02:38.380
as a symbol of happiness
throughout the ages!

02:38.380 --> 02:40.000
<b>FWUMP!</b>

02:38.750 --> 02:40.540
We shared our home with them!

02:40.000 --> 02:42.750
<b>FWUMP!</b>

02:40.540 --> 02:42.750
And prospered alongside them!

02:43.000 --> 02:45.210
Thank you, octopuses! Thank you, octopuses!

02:45.210 --> 02:46.750
That's just bonkers.
Thank you, octopuses! Thank you, octopuses!<b></b>

02:46.750 --> 02:49.290
Well, taking a closer look at them...

02:49.290 --> 02:51.540
these little guys are cuter than I thought!

02:54.290 --> 02:57.040
It's nice to see that you understand
their charm, Miss Shinobu.

02:57.040 --> 02:59.210
U-uh, yeah, I guess...

02:59.210 --> 03:02.250
Oh, quit looking all smug just because
she gave your dumb octopuses a compliment!

03:02.250 --> 03:04.540
Yeah, man! There's nothing special
about octopuses!

03:05.710 --> 03:07.380
Nothing special, you say?

03:13.580 --> 03:15.170
Antarctic octopus?

03:15.170 --> 03:16.330
Indeed!

03:16.330 --> 03:20.130
Just as the name implies,
it can only be found in Antarctica!

03:20.580 --> 03:23.380
And within the world of octopuses,
it's the rarest of rare species!

03:23.380 --> 03:25.540
The Mendo family's greatest treasure!

03:25.880 --> 03:27.460
Cool story.

03:27.460 --> 03:29.210
But I think this is going overboard.

03:29.210 --> 03:32.420
You made this giant freezer room
just for an octopus?

03:34.830 --> 03:37.500
They've even got a freakin' blizzard
blowing so it can feel at home.

03:37.500 --> 03:38.750
Of course.

03:38.750 --> 03:41.830
It's a special octopus that can only be
raised in conditions like the south pole!

03:44.080 --> 03:46.630
Moroboshi. You should feel honored.

03:46.630 --> 03:51.210
Because just one look at this Mendo family
treasure will have you quivering in pure awe!

03:51.210 --> 03:52.540
Sure, whatever.

04:12.290 --> 04:14.250
Aw c'mere, Matsuchiyo!

04:14.250 --> 04:15.790
It's great to see you!

04:15.790 --> 04:17.210
Is this a friggin' joke?

04:17.790 --> 04:19.460
It's a plain ol' octopus.

04:19.460 --> 04:21.130
What makes this one special?

04:21.130 --> 04:22.880
Probably just the fact
it lives in the Antarctic.

04:22.880 --> 04:25.250
Doesn't seem like it can do any cool tricks.

04:25.250 --> 04:27.170
The look on its face
isn't even out of the ordinary!

04:27.170 --> 04:31.630
As if! You're just a bunch of fools who can't
appreciate the real value of things!

04:31.630 --> 04:33.330
Oh please, this thing is worthless!

04:33.330 --> 04:34.960
Argh! This is so stupid!

04:34.960 --> 04:38.210
I can't believe we froze our butts off
just to come see this thing!

04:38.420 --> 04:41.580
I would've preferred going to a takoyaki stand
to eat some octopus balls instead!

04:45.380 --> 04:49.460
ANY INSULT AGAINST THIS OCTOPUS
IS AN INSULT AGAINST THE MENDO FAMILY!

04:49.460 --> 04:52.790
YOU KNAVE! GET DOWN ON YOUR KNEES!
I'LL CHOP YOUR HEAD CLEAN OFF!

04:52.790 --> 04:54.580
GOOD THING I'M NOT IN YOUR FAMILY,

04:54.580 --> 04:56.540
CUZ I'D HATE BEING ON
THE SAME LEVEL AS AN OCTOPUS!

04:56.540 --> 04:59.500
BASTARD! HOW DARE YOU SAY THAT!

05:00.080 --> 05:01.880
Where are you going, little guy?

05:03.500 --> 05:04.960
Matsuchiyo!

05:06.210 --> 05:09.580
So hey... did it just run away or what?

05:10.250 --> 05:12.750
OH NOOOOOOOOOOO!

05:13.670 --> 05:15.710
Master Matsuchiyo has fled his habitat!

05:15.710 --> 05:17.420
All personnel are ordered to search for him!

05:17.420 --> 05:20.500
I repeat! Master Matsuchiyo
has fled his habitat!

05:21.000 --> 05:22.330
What?!

05:22.330 --> 05:24.500
You want us to help find your dumb octopus?

05:24.500 --> 05:25.670
Obviously!

05:25.670 --> 05:27.880
You guys hurt Matsuchiyo
with all your insults!

05:27.880 --> 05:29.500
That's why he ran away!

05:29.500 --> 05:31.420
What a waste of time. I'm outta here!

05:31.420 --> 05:33.670
I'll grant you anything in my power
if he's found.

05:35.170 --> 05:36.420
Anything?

05:36.420 --> 05:37.290
Huh?

05:38.960 --> 05:41.330
<b>MAGIC REALM!</b>

05:38.960 --> 05:41.330
<b>JUNGLE OF TERROR</b>

05:43.540 --> 05:44.960
Not good.

05:44.960 --> 05:47.670
This tropical greenhouse is the last place
I wanted him to end up in.

05:49.460 --> 05:51.880
Unless we find and return him
to the freezer room quickly,

05:51.880 --> 05:53.960
this could turn into a disaster...

05:55.250 --> 05:57.960
I'm gonna claim Ryoko for my reward!

05:58.830 --> 06:01.080
I'll work hard to find him, Big Brother!

06:01.080 --> 06:02.790
Since when did I become your big brother?!

06:02.790 --> 06:03.750
Aw, come on. We're gonna be brothers-in-law.

06:03.750 --> 06:05.000
Back off! Don't you dare say it again!
Aw, come on. We're gonna be brothers-in-law.<b></b>

06:05.000 --> 06:07.000
Before my darling has a chance to find it,
Back off! Don't you dare say it again!<b>
Chill out, Big Brother!</b>

06:07.000 --> 06:08.960
I'll have to beat him to the punch!
Dammit! I told you not to say it!<b></b>

06:09.130 --> 06:11.500
Matsuchiyo! Matsuchiyo!

06:13.670 --> 06:16.290
Here, Mendo. Please marry me.

06:16.290 --> 06:17.330
Sure.

06:22.670 --> 06:26.790
So I want a sailor uniform, a bra,
plus a b-bikini swimsuit...

06:26.790 --> 06:28.500
Cold hard cash! Cold hard cash!

06:28.500 --> 06:30.330
Hmm... should I ask for some speakers?

06:30.330 --> 06:32.750
A picture of me together with Lum!

06:35.540 --> 06:36.710
What's wrong?

06:36.710 --> 06:39.750
Oh, I thought there was something behind us.

06:39.750 --> 06:41.250
But it was just my imagination.

06:45.540 --> 06:46.830
A leech?

06:47.920 --> 06:49.210
A leech...

06:49.710 --> 06:51.540
OH GOD, LEECHES!

06:51.540 --> 06:54.500
Get them off me, get them off me,
get them off me!

06:54.500 --> 06:58.330
Okay! I know! Just let me go for a second!

07:00.460 --> 07:02.290
CR-CROCODILES!

07:02.290 --> 07:04.000
Whoa, stay calm!

07:04.000 --> 07:06.580
Don't provoke them!
J-just stand up nice and slow...

07:08.170 --> 07:09.250
<b>RAWRRRR!</b>

07:09.420 --> 07:10.250
Huh?

07:11.460 --> 07:12.500
Oh crap!

07:13.080 --> 07:14.250
Darling!

07:15.040 --> 07:16.210
Don't eat me!

07:16.210 --> 07:18.790
Cut that out right noooooow!

07:19.000 --> 07:20.210
<b>ZAP</b>

07:20.330 --> 07:21.830
I forgot to tell you!

07:21.830 --> 07:23.500
We use this tropical greenhouse

07:23.500 --> 07:25.540
as a free range for leopards, snakes,
and other wild creatures.

07:25.540 --> 07:26.630
So please be careful!

07:26.630 --> 07:28.500
How could you forget that?!
You dumbass!

07:28.500 --> 07:31.420
We needed to know that
before we came in here, dammit!

07:41.580 --> 07:42.750
Kosuke!

07:42.750 --> 07:43.830
What happened?!

07:43.830 --> 07:44.670
Oh no, Kosuke!

07:44.670 --> 07:46.000
You okay, Kosuke?!

07:46.000 --> 07:47.460
We're on the way, buddy!

07:48.500 --> 07:50.000
What the hell, you buttwipes!

07:50.000 --> 07:51.500
Why are you running the other way?!

07:51.500 --> 07:53.500
Are you just going to abandon your friend?!

07:53.500 --> 07:55.250
I say get while the getting is good!

07:55.250 --> 07:56.250
Stupid jerks!

07:56.250 --> 07:57.750
Guess it's up to us!

07:57.750 --> 07:59.130
Hang on, Kosuke!

08:05.540 --> 08:07.210
This stuff is...

08:07.920 --> 08:09.170
black ink.

08:09.170 --> 08:10.000
Ink?

08:10.000 --> 08:12.540
That's weird. Why is there ink in the jungle?

08:15.830 --> 08:17.710
Matsuchiyoooo!

08:17.710 --> 08:19.130
Hey octopus!

08:19.130 --> 08:20.250
Helloooo!

08:20.670 --> 08:22.420
Aw jeez, where is h-

08:22.420 --> 08:23.500
What the?

08:24.540 --> 08:26.130
Oh man, look at them...

08:26.130 --> 08:27.880
These dudes are from Mendo's security team!

08:27.880 --> 08:29.670
What are these marks?

08:29.670 --> 08:32.630
It's almost like something was stuck on them.

08:34.920 --> 08:37.710
Matsuchiyo! Matsuchiyo!

08:39.290 --> 08:40.880
38 degrees!

08:40.880 --> 08:42.380
Time is running out.

08:42.380 --> 08:45.040
No... it may already be too late.

08:45.040 --> 08:46.790
This heat spells trouble.

08:48.000 --> 08:50.380
Wh-what happened here?!

08:50.920 --> 08:53.580
Yikes. I get the feeling we're in deep doo-doo.

08:53.580 --> 08:55.000
No kidding!

08:55.000 --> 08:57.080
Let's just find that stupid octopus
and get outta here!

08:57.080 --> 09:01.290
It's not that simple. Trying to find one
little octopus in this huge jungle

09:01.290 --> 09:02.920
is pretty much impossible.

09:03.080 --> 09:04.460
Here's an idea.

09:04.460 --> 09:07.790
How about we find a fake Matsuchiyo
to catch and bring back instead?

09:07.790 --> 09:10.920
Yeah. I was just thinking the same thing.

09:11.880 --> 09:13.580
Let's see...

09:15.040 --> 09:16.330
How about this?

09:16.330 --> 09:17.630
Will this one work?!

09:17.630 --> 09:19.830
I think mine is the most convincing.

09:21.040 --> 09:22.210
That was Shinobu's voice!

09:22.210 --> 09:23.250
Oh no!

09:23.250 --> 09:25.080
What's the matter?!

09:36.960 --> 09:39.380
Eek! Someone help!

09:39.380 --> 09:40.710
Crap, we were too late!

09:40.710 --> 09:42.000
Look, Mendo!

09:43.710 --> 09:45.130
What's this supposed to be...?

09:45.130 --> 09:47.000
It's Matsuchiyo, Big Brother!

09:48.040 --> 09:51.920
QUIT MAKING STUPID JOKES
WHILE I'M SUFFERING OVER HERE!

09:51.920 --> 09:54.170
Just what the hell is going on, man?

09:54.170 --> 09:56.380
Yeah, so, I forgot to explain.

09:56.380 --> 09:57.960
Antarctic octopuses are a rare breed

09:57.960 --> 10:00.330
that grow gigantic when
exposed to high temperature...

10:00.330 --> 10:03.670
AND THAT'S PART OF WHAT
MAKES THEM SO SPECIAL!

10:05.210 --> 10:06.000
<b>WHACK!</b>

10:06.210 --> 10:07.630
WHO GIVES A SHIT ABOUT THAT!

10:07.630 --> 10:09.210
WE'VE HAD IT WITH YOUR CRAZY PETS!

10:09.210 --> 10:11.330
Stop fighting and help us already, you guys!

10:11.330 --> 10:12.460
Okay.

10:20.080 --> 10:22.040
CHAAAAARGE!

10:22.040 --> 10:23.460
Oh, darling!

10:23.790 --> 10:25.210
TAKE THIIIIIS!

10:26.000 --> 10:28.000
What the? Aw crap! It's stuck!

10:29.170 --> 10:30.170
Darling!

10:30.170 --> 10:32.380
Ugh! Get it together, darn it!

10:35.670 --> 10:38.790
Its body is too squishy!
Nothing that we try is doing any damage!

10:38.790 --> 10:39.790
Dammit!

10:39.790 --> 10:41.250
Man, this sucks!

10:41.250 --> 10:42.330
I can't move!

10:42.330 --> 10:43.750
It's too freaking strong!

10:43.750 --> 10:44.750
No, stop it!

10:44.750 --> 10:46.170
You big freak!

10:46.290 --> 10:48.040
<b>RIIIIIIIP!</b>

10:48.330 --> 10:51.080
D-dammit! Keep your tentacles off me!

10:51.080 --> 10:51.920
Knock it off!

10:51.920 --> 10:53.290
That's totally uncalled for!

10:53.290 --> 10:56.460
You better stop getting touchy feely!
Or you're in for a world of hurt!

10:56.460 --> 10:57.460
Don't stop now!

10:57.460 --> 10:58.580
Rip it all off!

10:58.580 --> 10:59.460
Go, Matsuchiyo!

11:00.540 --> 11:01.670
You can't!

11:01.670 --> 11:04.000
Being pure and innocent is my selling point!

11:03.830 --> 11:05.710
<b>Oh really?</b>

11:04.000 --> 11:05.580
Got that?!

11:05.580 --> 11:08.670
Hold the phone!
Are you saying I'm the smutty type?!
No more! Get back! Get back! Get back!<b></b>

11:08.670 --> 11:11.080
We're gonna be stuck here
all day at this rate!

11:11.380 --> 11:12.380
<b>CHOMP!</b>

11:12.540 --> 11:14.830
<b>KAZAPZAZP!</b>

11:18.790 --> 11:22.790
Are you okay?! Miss Lum!
Miss Shinobu! Miss Ryunosuke!

11:25.670 --> 11:29.920
How is it you always show up
at the most opportune times, dammit?

11:30.290 --> 11:32.710
Fighting an octopus goes against
my code of honor, I'm afraid.

11:32.710 --> 11:34.830
STUFF A SOCK IN IT, YOU BLOWHARD!

11:36.880 --> 11:38.000
Matsuchiyo!

11:39.210 --> 11:41.250
Come back to the Antarctic dome.

11:41.250 --> 11:43.790
Listen. You know you can't live here.

11:45.330 --> 11:47.250
Okay? So let's go.

11:53.790 --> 11:56.250
Yeesh. Look at them getting
all warm and fuzzy.

11:58.080 --> 12:00.960
GAH! MATSUCHIYOOOOOO!

11:58.330 --> 12:00.000
<b>SQUEEZE</b>

12:02.130 --> 12:05.330
Being squeezed to death by an octopus
is probably how he wanted to die anyway.

12:05.330 --> 12:07.500
It's an "intimate" embrace, for sure!

12:20.250 --> 12:21.830
There's nothing to do...

12:26.670 --> 12:29.290
I'm gonna go see what Lum
and them are up to.

12:32.000 --> 12:33.830
Boy, I'm hungry!

12:34.580 --> 12:36.630
Nice! Little hamburg steaks!

12:36.630 --> 12:40.630
Aw jeez, eating before lunchtime?
Yer such a glutton.

12:40.630 --> 12:42.290
What hole did you craw out of?!

12:42.290 --> 12:44.540
Get lost! You'll ruin the taste of my lunch!

12:44.540 --> 12:47.580
Yer earthling food always looks so grotesque!

12:47.580 --> 12:50.130
Who cares what you think? I said get lost!

12:50.830 --> 12:52.960
Hey, hold on. What is that thing?

12:52.960 --> 12:54.290
That little red ball?

12:54.290 --> 12:56.880
Man, you're annoying.
It's a pickled umeboshi plum.

12:56.880 --> 12:58.080
Now go away!

12:58.080 --> 13:00.830
Oh yeah? What a bizarre thing to eat.

13:00.830 --> 13:02.710
I bet that it tastes awful!

13:05.080 --> 13:06.540
You wanna try it, dontcha?

13:06.790 --> 13:09.460
Ya must be crazy if you think
I wanna eat that ugly thing!

13:09.460 --> 13:11.000
Open wide.

13:12.080 --> 13:13.250
Go on.

13:19.960 --> 13:21.170
Enjoy, rugrat!

13:21.170 --> 13:23.790
That's what you get for butting in
on my meal time!

13:28.750 --> 13:30.750
What's the matter, little Ten?

13:30.750 --> 13:34.250
Darling! I told you to quit
playing pranks on him!

13:34.250 --> 13:35.790
I didn't do anything.

13:37.670 --> 13:39.920
Thish feelsh so gewd!

13:47.670 --> 13:51.170
Hey! It's not good manners
to shoot fire at ladies like that!

13:58.500 --> 14:00.170
Oh no! Everybody get down!

14:00.170 --> 14:01.790
Nice Mendo! Just stay right there!

14:02.500 --> 14:04.830
Wow! I didn't know you were so flexible!

14:07.080 --> 14:08.750
Crap, not my lunch!

14:10.000 --> 14:11.670
Congrats on surviving that.

14:11.670 --> 14:13.170
He's non-burnable garbage.

14:13.630 --> 14:17.000
Hey! This little guy is drunk!

14:17.000 --> 14:19.250
I can't believe you gave him booze, Ataru!

14:19.460 --> 14:20.670
Darling!

14:20.670 --> 14:21.830
I didn't do jack!

14:21.830 --> 14:23.710
Dude. Get your lunchbox out.

14:23.710 --> 14:24.710
Why?

14:24.710 --> 14:27.500
Just do it.
It's gonna prove that I'm innocent!

14:27.500 --> 14:30.380
This better not be some
elaborate scheme to eat my lunch.

14:30.380 --> 14:32.040
Do you think I'd stoop that low?

14:32.040 --> 14:33.830
Yeah. Totally.

14:35.540 --> 14:37.080
I'm just taking your pickled plum.

14:37.080 --> 14:39.460
Dude! You stole one of my
sausages, didn't you?!

14:39.460 --> 14:41.210
Hey, Lum. Say "ahhh".

14:42.040 --> 14:43.420
Don't try and weasel out of it!

14:43.420 --> 14:44.920
Admit you took my sausage!

14:46.170 --> 14:47.290
So sour!

14:47.290 --> 14:49.130
See? I knew nobody could
get drunk off that.
So sour!<b></b>

14:49.130 --> 14:50.040
See? I knew nobody could
get drunk off that.

14:50.040 --> 14:52.210
Hm? What's the matter, Kosuke?

14:52.210 --> 14:54.460
I wanna know where
my sausage went, dammit!

14:54.460 --> 14:56.670
Nobody cares about
either of your problems.

14:56.670 --> 14:58.540
These guys just get
more pathetic every day.

14:58.540 --> 15:00.000
Right, Miss Lum?

15:01.210 --> 15:02.500
Miss Lum...?

15:13.880 --> 15:15.710
It's so hot...

15:18.000 --> 15:18.830
<b>FAWHOOOOOSH!</b>

15:24.830 --> 15:27.500
This is dumb.
What are you guys so excited about?

15:27.500 --> 15:29.790
Lum always wears that outfit!

15:30.790 --> 15:32.170
Uh, Lum?

15:32.170 --> 15:33.630
Darling...

15:33.630 --> 15:34.790
She's drunk.

15:36.750 --> 15:41.630
WHAT KINDA STUPID TALK IS THAT!
I'M NOT DRUNK, YOU JEEEEEEEERK!

15:42.880 --> 15:44.580
Pickled plums...

15:45.670 --> 15:46.920
Pickled plums!

15:47.250 --> 15:49.630
Just hand them over nice and easy...

15:49.630 --> 15:51.580
Hurry...

15:51.580 --> 15:54.540
I WANT THEM NOOOOOW!

15:54.540 --> 15:55.960
Okay!

15:57.500 --> 15:59.960
<b>Pickled</b>

16:00.170 --> 16:01.040
Take it!

16:01.250 --> 16:02.000
Take it!

16:02.170 --> 16:02.790
Take it!

16:02.790 --> 16:03.330
Take it!

16:03.460 --> 16:04.210
This one too!

16:07.040 --> 16:09.790
THIS FEELS AWESOOOOOME!

16:10.540 --> 16:11.830
Miss Lum!

16:11.830 --> 16:13.290
Hey, Ataru!

16:13.290 --> 16:14.790
Snap out of it!

16:14.790 --> 16:16.630
You gotta hurry and get Lum under control!

16:16.630 --> 16:17.630
Why's it gotta be me?

16:17.630 --> 16:19.290
Because you got her drunk, dumbass!

16:19.750 --> 16:21.460
I don't see Ten anywhere!

16:21.460 --> 16:23.500
He's even more dangerous than Lum is!

16:23.500 --> 16:25.250
Okay, here's the deal, Ataru!

16:25.250 --> 16:27.170
You're responsible for
capturing the little rugrat!

16:27.170 --> 16:28.130
Seriously?

16:30.170 --> 16:31.500
Miss Lum!

16:32.630 --> 16:34.290
Where's my darling...?

16:34.290 --> 16:37.000
He's, uh, out looking for Ten.

16:37.000 --> 16:38.460
For Ten...?

16:38.460 --> 16:39.170
Yes.

16:39.920 --> 16:41.880
No! It can't be!

16:43.710 --> 16:45.130
Dumb darling...

16:45.540 --> 16:47.540
What's the matter, Miss Lum?

16:47.540 --> 16:49.330
My darling...

16:49.710 --> 16:53.920
HE CARES MORE ABOUT TEN
THAN MEEEEEEE!

16:49.710 --> 16:53.920
<b>BZZT</b>

16:54.170 --> 16:56.000
Hurry, sir! This way!

16:57.170 --> 16:59.960
<b>WAAAAH!</b>

17:00.170 --> 17:01.830
O-oh no, she's drunk!

17:02.500 --> 17:04.630
Everyone back to class, now!

17:04.630 --> 17:06.290
I'm going to do a search
of your belongings!

17:06.290 --> 17:08.920
You must be kidding!
We've got bigger problems!

17:08.920 --> 17:12.080
I'm going to find out which one of you
no-good miscreants brought alcohol on campus!

17:12.830 --> 17:14.540
Where are you going now, Lum?

17:15.330 --> 17:17.250
Hey! Get back here, you punks!

17:17.250 --> 17:19.750
No way.
Just go do your check or whatever!

17:20.460 --> 17:22.500
Daaaaarling!

17:22.750 --> 17:24.710
You bunch of chickens!

17:24.710 --> 17:26.130
Daaaaarling!

17:26.130 --> 17:27.460
All right, fine then.

17:27.460 --> 17:29.330
What do we get after you
turn out to be wrong?

17:29.330 --> 17:31.330
You're gonna owe us more than an apology.

17:31.330 --> 17:34.540
W-well, what if you get busted
for having booze, huh?!

17:34.540 --> 17:36.920
If you actually find any,
then we'll dance naked!

17:36.920 --> 17:39.670
N-naked dancing it is, then!
I'm holding you to that!

17:39.670 --> 17:40.540
Damn delinquents!

17:40.540 --> 17:42.330
A warrior never goes back on his word!

17:42.830 --> 17:43.920
Hmph!

17:44.880 --> 17:47.420
Man... what a pain in the butt.

17:47.420 --> 17:48.830
Hey, rugrat!

17:49.460 --> 17:51.250
You wanna go get some ramen?

17:51.250 --> 17:53.420
Really, man? You're just gonna bail?

17:53.420 --> 17:55.500
We've looked all over the place for him.

17:55.500 --> 17:57.170
I bet he's already left the school.

17:57.170 --> 17:59.250
I'll go with, but only if you pay.

17:59.250 --> 18:01.250
Why the hell should I have to pay for you?

18:01.250 --> 18:03.460
Cuz you stole my lunch, jackass!

18:03.460 --> 18:05.540
You're too stubborn for your own good, dude.

18:05.540 --> 18:08.290
Keep committing all those stupid details
to memory and your brain will turn to mush.

18:08.290 --> 18:10.630
Oh shut up! Get off your damn high horse!

18:11.460 --> 18:14.580
DARLING, YOU BIG STUPID JERK!

18:14.960 --> 18:16.670
HOW COULD YOU BETRAY ME?!

18:16.670 --> 18:17.880
What'd I do...?

18:16.670 --> 18:19.710
<b>ZAP</b>

18:17.880 --> 18:20.830
It's impossible to make any sense
of drunk people logic, dude.

18:17.880 --> 18:19.710
<b>BLAAAAARGH!</b>

18:20.380 --> 18:23.000
<b>HEE HEE HEE</b>

18:21.830 --> 18:23.670
Daaaaaarling!

18:25.880 --> 18:28.170
<b>FWOOOOOOSH!</b>

18:28.290 --> 18:29.790
Hot! Hot! Hot!

18:29.790 --> 18:32.210
Darling! Come back here!

18:34.420 --> 18:36.710
What in blazes happened here?

18:36.710 --> 18:38.630
All these boys have been electrified.

18:38.630 --> 18:40.830
It's almost as if Lum came through here...

18:40.830 --> 18:42.830
Yeah, Lum just passed by a minute ago.

18:42.830 --> 18:44.380
I see you've got light burns.

18:44.380 --> 18:46.380
I need some first aid, too!

18:49.500 --> 18:51.630
Yippee, it's Sakura!

18:55.750 --> 18:57.500
Watch out, Miss Sakura!

18:58.000 --> 18:59.290
I'm glad you're all right.

18:59.290 --> 19:00.710
I can't believe you...

19:00.710 --> 19:02.130
Shucks!

19:02.130 --> 19:03.750
Yikes, that was so scary!

19:03.750 --> 19:05.420
This situation is already chaotic enough...

19:05.500 --> 19:06.250
<b>KERPOW!</b>

19:06.880 --> 19:08.080
...WITHOUT YOUR HORNDOGGING!

19:08.080 --> 19:10.210
Oh c'mon! We saved you
from those flames!

19:10.210 --> 19:13.380
Sakura! You could at least
give them some first aid.

19:13.380 --> 19:15.250
Quit popping up out of nowhere!

19:15.250 --> 19:17.380
Here, you can use this
to disinfect their wounds.

19:16.420 --> 19:19.790
<b>SHOCHU</b>

19:17.380 --> 19:19.790
Oh jeez, what are you doing
walking around with alcohol for?

19:20.040 --> 19:22.290
Because winter is
the best time to drink shochu.

19:22.290 --> 19:25.710
Fine then. I can't abandon my
precious students in need of help.

19:25.710 --> 19:27.210
But first, a little taste test.

19:32.630 --> 19:34.080
Do it mouth-to-mouth!

19:35.170 --> 19:38.580
So this is the kinda stuff
that you prefer over me...?

19:41.130 --> 19:46.170
DUMB DARLING!
YOU CHEATING SCUMBAG!

19:48.210 --> 19:50.330
I hate you darling!
You can die for all I care!

19:52.170 --> 19:55.170
She took my shochu with her...

19:55.460 --> 19:57.420
Having some trouble there, teach?

19:57.420 --> 19:59.630
You were sure we had booze, so where is it?

19:59.630 --> 20:00.830
Doggone it!

20:00.830 --> 20:01.960
Curses!

20:02.500 --> 20:04.460
There's nothing here! Nothing at all!

20:06.170 --> 20:08.630
AHHH! THERE!

20:09.380 --> 20:11.250
BOOZE! FOUND IT!

20:09.380 --> 20:11.250
<b>SHOCHU</b>

20:12.330 --> 20:14.420
Yeah! You're busted!

20:14.420 --> 20:16.040
What's all the fuss about?

20:17.880 --> 20:19.290
It's my darling!

20:20.040 --> 20:23.500
I'm so happy that
you're still alive, darling!

20:20.290 --> 20:23.500
<b>ZAP</b>

20:24.000 --> 20:26.250
I won't let anybody kill me off that easily!

20:26.250 --> 20:27.080
Oh, darling!

20:27.080 --> 20:29.080
Alright! Time to face the music!

20:29.080 --> 20:31.540
You boys are gonna have to dance naked!

20:31.540 --> 20:34.080
Mendo's the only one of us
who actually agreed to that deal!

20:34.080 --> 20:35.540
Start dancing, Mendo!

20:35.540 --> 20:37.790
YOU FILTHY TURNCOATS!

20:37.790 --> 20:39.380
Go on! Do it!

20:39.380 --> 20:41.330
Not my precious shochu!

20:41.330 --> 20:43.420
Can I please have it back now...?

20:43.420 --> 20:44.670
Darliiiiiiiiiing!
Dance! Now!<b></b>

20:44.670 --> 20:45.630
Hurry up, Mendo!

20:45.630 --> 20:46.920
Get off me, lowlifes!

20:47.500 --> 20:50.420
It's not enough, I want more love

20:50.420 --> 20:53.420
I can't imagine myself with anyone other than you

20:53.420 --> 20:56.170
So fall for me and look only at me

20:56.170 --> 20:59.170
I already love you even down to your marrow

21:10.330 --> 21:13.380
Deep in those eyes, who are you waiting for?

21:13.380 --> 21:16.330
All you've shown me is your face from the side

21:16.330 --> 21:17.750
I want to know

21:17.750 --> 21:20.080
Give me love, give me love, that's all

21:21.880 --> 21:24.920
Out of every planet it was Earth that I came to

21:24.920 --> 21:27.750
Because your presence drew me to it

21:27.750 --> 21:29.960
I want you to respond, to the vagueness

21:29.960 --> 21:31.040
To I need you

21:31.040 --> 21:32.290
I wanna solve the complication

21:32.290 --> 21:33.830
I want shared love

21:33.830 --> 21:35.500
C'mon c'mon, darling darling

21:35.500 --> 21:36.880
Even if we get separated

21:36.880 --> 21:38.380
C'mon c'mon, darling darling

21:38.380 --> 21:39.670
At the ends of the universe

21:39.670 --> 21:42.170
Just sew the stars and moon together

21:42.170 --> 21:44.170
And draw them close

21:44.170 --> 21:45.130
After all

21:45.130 --> 21:47.830
It's not enough, I want more love

21:47.830 --> 21:50.790
I can't imagine myself with anyone other than you

21:50.790 --> 21:53.670
So fall for me and look only at me

21:53.670 --> 21:56.500
I already love you even down to your marrow

21:56.500 --> 21:59.420
No way no way, don't run off somewhere

21:59.420 --> 22:02.250
I want to revolve around the planet known as you

22:02.250 --> 22:05.130
Hey look this way, then look that way

22:05.130 --> 22:08.250
In spite of everything, I'm just so in love with you

22:08.460 --> 22:09.920
Absolutely, absolutely

22:09.920 --> 22:11.290
I'll give you a shock

22:11.290 --> 22:12.830
Enough, enough

22:12.830 --> 22:14.250
Not enough love

22:20.210 --> 22:22.670
Is all going according to plan?

22:20.290 --> 22:22.670
<b>Secret Strategy Meeting</b>

22:22.790 --> 22:24.080
Of course!

22:24.080 --> 22:28.040
We used a computer and plotted
everything out down to the very last detail.

22:28.040 --> 22:31.290
All that's left for us to do now
is to put things in motion.

22:31.290 --> 22:32.750
I'm itching to get started!

22:34.540 --> 22:37.210
This one will be the first to go down...

22:38.210 --> 22:40.500
Enjoy the last moments
you have in this world!

22:40.500 --> 22:42.380
Because your time is up...

22:42.380 --> 22:44.170
...and we're gonna end you!

22:46.000 --> 22:50.420
<b>Recovering That Which Was Lost</b>

22:46.210 --> 22:48.290
On the next episode of "Urusei Yatsura".

22:48.290 --> 22:50.420
Aw crap! That's my chain!
